                        "status": "completed"
                    }
                ],
                "pool": "idle",
                "text": "\"Heard you were up at Number Nine,\" Jory Kemp says. \"Everybody heard. By the second pint they'd all heard what, and no two of them the same. That's Brackwater.\" He pulls you something without asking.",
