                        "quest": "the_quarterly_meeting",
                        "status": "completed"
                    }
                ],
                "pool": "idle",
                "text": "Jory chalks the tide on the board. \"Tull's in on the fifth if you want the valley again,\" he says. \"Or there's plenty of river the other way.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "A room.",
