                        "end": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "text": "\"Off Tull's boat,\" says the broad man behind the bar, who has clearly said it to everyone off Tull's boat for twenty years. \"Jory Kemp. Eight a night, a fire at each end, and the board'll tell you what the tide's doing, which is more than the river ever did for you up there.\"",
                "choices": [
